# Down There | INT | The Underworld Barn | NIGHT | thiess | Fight for it | A barn without walls, seed heaped like gold. Sorcerers with broom handles; dogs with iron whips. He takes a blow across the nose and a sack in his teeth | The blossom is won back | 7 | crowd=60, animals=wolves, stunts=whip and broom melee, vfx=underworld granary
# The Sentence | INT | Manor Court | DAY | gertrud_son, thiess, von_palmberg | Ask the right thing | The notary asks what happened the year he was ill. The old man says: you remember. They do | The court half believes him | 5 | crowd=30
